dimetric-input 1
seed 42
engine 0.0.1
players 1
# tick  buttons move_x move_y aim, per player
#
# A whole room of the run: walk in, clear it, then take the second
# upgrade offered. The seeded stream offers swift/ward/fierce, and holding
# bolt and ward together evolves into the Lance — which is the thing this
# fixture exists to pin down.
#
# Buttons are a hex mask: 0001 fire, 0002 alt, 0004 dash, 0008 use. While
# an upgrade is offered those three pick the three choices.
#
# Every number here is exactly representable in fixed point. 0.4 is
# not, and the loader refuses it (DIM0703) rather than rounding.
